WEBVTT

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:20.110
That wasn't enough to take away my power!

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.470
Jack, I'm sorry.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:28.330
I just wanted you to rethink the way 
you battle instead of relying on power.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:30.860
Jack…

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.740
I won't abandon power!

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.240
Jack...

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.100
Why?

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:51.160
We didn't determine who won and lost, 
but I was clearly being pressured.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:58.410
My power didn't work against a child...

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.970
No, that's not true!

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.310
If the duel continued, I wouldn't have lost!

00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:08.640
My power would have destroyed 
everything to pieces!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:14.490
I won't abandon power!  It's the 
only way I know how to battle!

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:25.850
What is this place?

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:38.880
This is the work of the Crimson Devil.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.620
What happened, old man?

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:44.270
This is the work of the Crimson Devil.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.580
The Crimson Devil destroyed this village.

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.380
Crimson Devil?

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:53.170
Is this the destroyed village 
that Bommer was talking about?

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.320
What happened to the other villagers?

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:00.510
They left the village.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.570
This is the work of the Crimson Devil.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.440
Over here.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:26.260
Who is that?

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.370
Wait!

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.220
Riding Duels.

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:34.370
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:41.210
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:02.530
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:12.640
Soar in the infinite skies  BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:18.880
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:24.850
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:30.620
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:36.230
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:42.600
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:48.410
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:54.710
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:03:54.710 --> 00:04:01.020
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:31.020
Crimson Devil

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.940
Crimson Devil?

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.570
Who are you?

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:11.340
Jack Atlas, I'm the Crimson Devil's familiar.

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.870
Crimson Devil?

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:18.430
Old man, enough of your foolishness!

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.330
If you keep mocking me-

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.730
My master is speaking!

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:30.720
He says he'll fulfill any wish you desire.

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:36.380
Since he's the devil, he can 
make anything come true.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:39.820
What I desire…

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.050
Isn't it obvious?

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:47.260
I want overwhelming power 
that can destroy everyone!

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.260
Then come over here.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:55.950
Come to the Crimson Devil.  
Crimson Devil is waiting for you.

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:05.260
This is the work of the Crimson Devil.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:31.070
What?  The monsters that Max used in his 
duel against Jack aren't in his deck?

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.260
It was bugging me, so I looked at Max's deck.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.280
Did he really use that deck against Jack?

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:41.750
Yeah.  Max only has one deck.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:44.960
That's strange.  What did Max say?

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:49.410
He says that he remembers 
dueling Jack, but…

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:56.040
Max doesn't remember what 
happened during the duel.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:03.510
Bommer, can I ask you something?  
Why did you want Max to duel Jack?

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.510
Max is only a child.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:15.150
Even if he managed to deal one serious blow, 
Jack's overwhelming power would've defeated him.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.210
So why?

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.790
I don't know myself.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:22.400
You don't know?

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:26.420
I thought my dream was a premonition.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:30.800
I wanted Jack to realize that 
he trusted his power too much.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.570
That's why I wanted Jack to duel.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.780
But why Max?

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:41.940
Why did you invite us?  Why Jack?

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:45.420
Because I had that dream.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.010
Why did you think Jack was going 
to die when you had that dream?

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:51.940
I don't know.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:53.720
Bommer?

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:58.510
Bommer!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:01.130
Crimson Devil…

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.670
Bommer, what's wrong?

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:08.170
Was I being used?

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:09.860
What do you mean?

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.310
Jack!

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:30.220
Jack, I'm sorry.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.630
Jack!

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.100
Jack...

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:01.060
Give me power!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.200
Jack!

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.240
Jack?

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:10.960
Jack!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.560
Jack…

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:16.950
Max!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.070
What happened?

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:20.230
Jack…

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.610
Jack disappeared!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:23.940
Jack?

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.310
What are you talking about?

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:35.990
What's going on?  We built 
this temple by stacking rocks.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.680
Why is there a cave inside?

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.040
Did Jack go inside?

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.240
What's this?

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.150
What is this place?

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:30.290
Who are you?

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:37.010
I've been waiting for you, Jack Atlas.  
Welcome to Crimson Devil's home.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:39.700
Where is the Crimson Devil?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:47.090
My master is deep inside this temple.  
He's been waiting for you for a long time.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:51.060
Then he should show himself 
and give me power!

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:56.600
Yes, but there's a condition.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:57.800
Condition?

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:03.910
You must perform a contractual ritual 
with me, the Crimson Devil's familiar.

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:05.820
Contractual ritual?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:11.950
If you win, Crimson Devil will 
give you overwhelming power.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.810
Overwhelming power…

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.520
Fine!  What's the ritual?

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:21.110
A duel, of course.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:22.560
A duel?

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:43.060
This wasn't here when we 
were building the temple.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.410
This wasn't created by nature.

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.390
Someone built this.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:56.390
That means someone led me, 
Max and Jack to this place.

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:05.160
Will you accept this battle, Jack 
Atlas?  Or will you decline?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:16.560
I want power!

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:22.110
Start the ritual.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:26.960
I knew it! Let's make your wish come true!

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.080
It's showtime!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:36.230
The contractual ritual will now begin.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:40.820
Since long ago, the ritual is always a duel.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:44.500
If you defeat me, your wish will come true.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:53.950
Duel!

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.670
There's light over here!

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.440
What's this?

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:07.820
Jack!

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:10.010
Don't interfere!

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.180
Jack!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.560
Oh no!  The exit!  Jack!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:47.390
Yusei...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.410
Yusei!

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:55.620
Yusei!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:14:05.320
Jack, Crimson Devil's spirit used 
Max and me to bring you here.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.690
What?

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:15.540
It's too late.  The contractual 
ritual has already begun.

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.140
Our agreement is void!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.740
That's not allowed!

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:26.430
If you win this ritual, I'll 
give you power.  But if I win…

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:31.790
Your body will belong to Crimson Devil.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:33.670
What?

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:41.790
By taking over Jack Atlas's body, Crimson 
Devil will resurrect after a 10,000-year slumber.

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:47.110
You will be sacrificed for this ritual.

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:49.110
Stop messing around!

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:54.100
Jack, Crimson Devil himself chose you.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:15:01.580
Even if you fall into the depths of hell, 
your yearning for power still burns red.

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:09.590
You should be honored that Crimson Devil 
will resurrect and engulf your body.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:13.520
Go ahead and try to take my body!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.740
Jack!

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:19.230
Just wait, Yusei!  I'll finish him quickly!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:23.670
Then let's start the ritual.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:26.690
I'll go first.  My turn!

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.700
I summon Abyss Kid in defense position!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:39.490
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:43.260
The contractual ritual has started.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.710
Unbelievable.

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:49.780
What can you do with a monster 
with 0 defense points?

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:51.630
My turn!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.800
When monsters are only 
on the opponent's field,

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:58.100
I can summon Big Piece Golem 
without releasing another monster.

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:07.010
Big Piece Golem attacks Abyss Kid!

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:08.440
Power Pressure!

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:25.100
When Abyss Kid is sent to the graveyard, 
you take 800 points of damage.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.800
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:36.510
Since he knows how I battle, he's 
using a strategy that evades power.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.640
Just like the duel against Max.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.540
He controlled Max!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.180
My turn.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:45.720
I summon Abyss Boat Watchman!

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:57.100
Since Abyss Kid was destroyed, its graveyard 
effect destroys the monster on my field.

00:16:57.100 --> 00:17:02.160
When Abyss Boat Watchman is destroyed and sent 
to the graveyard, you take 800 points of damage!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:10.040
Then I activate the Continuous 
Spell Spirit Wave Barrier!

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:15.610
Monsters that attack me directly 
are negated and destroyed.

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:20.790
At the End Phase of my third turn after 
activation, this card is destroyed.

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.750
Though his field is wide 
open, Jack can't attack.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.520
I end my turn.

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:31.060
His strategy is to destroy 
his summoned monster by using

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:34.490
his graveyard monster's effect, 
and then he deals effect damage.

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:39.270
Though his field is wide open, his 
Continuous Spell prevents direct attacks.

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:41.950
His strategy is completely opposite 
of using power to battle.

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:45.400
Is he inviting me to attack?

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:51.500
This battle is the same 
as his battle against Max.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:56.020
What Jack does next will lead his 
destiny in different directions.

00:17:56.250 --> 00:18:01.410
Will he choose a new way to battle, or will 
he choose to battle by pressuring with power?

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.770
Jack…

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:10.360
I already know my answer!  I'll 
keep using power to defeat him!

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.220
My turn!

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:15.320
I summon Power Breaker from my hand!

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.420
If I can just destroy that card…

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.450
Power Breaker attacks you directly!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:32.580
Why?  The Continuous Spell 
prevents direct attacks!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.920
Power Slash!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:44.320
Why?  Due to Spirit Wave Barrier's effect, direct 
attacks are negated, and your monster is destroyed!

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.150
But when Power Breaker is destroyed,

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:54.800
one faceup spell or trap card 
on your field is destroyed!

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:56.650
Destroy Spirit Wave Barrier!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:04.020
Now your field is completely empty!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:06.350
Big Piece Golem attacks you directly!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.230
Power Pressure!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:13.130
I won't let you do that!  I flip over 
my trap card Guidance to the Abyss.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:17.140
When there are two Abyss 
monsters in my graveyard,

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:20.900
I can Special Summon one 
Abyss monster from my deck.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:24.630
I Special Summon Abyss 
Guardian in defense position!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:35.570
Due to Abyss Kid's effect from my 
graveyard, Abyss Guardian is destroyed.

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:41.200
When Abyss Guardian is destroyed 
and sent to the graveyard,

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.790
the Battle Phase ends, and you 
take 800 points of damage.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:56.310
By repeatedly summoning and destroying, 
he's playing around with Jack's power.

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:58.510
Actually, he's cornering him.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:02.450
Is my premonition coming true?

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:03.820
Jack…

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.780
I end my turn.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:08.510
My turn!

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:13.060
There's nothing left to do.  I end my turn.

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:15.850
That punk…

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.310
What was that?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.730
That looked like…

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.050
That's…

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:36.370
I know.  Why couldn't I remember?

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:40.220
There's an Earthbound Immortal 
known as Crimson Devil!

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.280
Earthbound Immortal?

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.920
5000 years ago, Earthbound Immortals 
were sealed inside geoglyphs.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.550
And 5000 years before that, there was

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:52.390
an Earthbound Immortal that pushed 
Crimson Dragon to its limits.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:55.250
It was sealed deeper than the geoglyphs.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:58.630
That Earthbound Immortal was Red Nova!

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:07.710
That's right.  My master is the Earthbound 
Immortal that even the Dark Signers couldn't control.

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:17.610
I feel the source of all fear...

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:25.190
You must be happy that Crimson 
Devil is about to resurrect!

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:29.170
That's…

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.980
Red Nova!

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:56.260
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:56.730 --> 00:22:02.970
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:21.250
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:26.890
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:32.500
You do this over and over

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:38.240
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:43.640
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.180 --> 00:22:51.150
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:56.890
Close to you  If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.290 --> 00:23:02.730
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:08.200
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:16.310
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
